Package: TwoStageTMLE
Title: Two-Stage Targeted Maximum Likelihood Estimation for Cluster Randomized Trials
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person("Laura B.", "Balzer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lbalzer@umass.edu"),
    person("Joshua", "Schwab", role = "aut",
           email = "jschwab77@berkeley.edu"))
Description: Implements the Two-Stage TMLE estimator of Balzer et al. (2021)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2106.15737> for cluster randomized trials. Stage 1
    fits an individual-level TMLE within each cluster separately to adjust
    for differential outcome measurement on baseline and post-baseline
    covariates. Stage 2 fits a cluster-level TMLE with Adaptive
    Pre-specification to flexibly select adjustment variables that
    optimise precision, while preserving Type-I error control.
